{"title":"Red Birch","slug":"Red_Birch","pageid":4198,"revid":21956,"timestamp":"2026-06-28T15:14:16Z","lastEditor":"Ilovechocolateyk","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Red Birch"},{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Hardness","value":"?"},{"label":"Log","value":"$?/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$20/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$25/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.0.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><big>\"Yup... yup. That's a red maple, ain't it?\"</big></i>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Red Birch</b> is an uncommon tree found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay</a> in Maple Forests. It closely resembles the regular <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Birch/\">Birch</a> tree, but with a more reddish bark and leaves to that of a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Maple/\">Red Maple</a> tree but more orangish.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2><p>\nThe various textures of the <b>Red Birch</b> in its raw/log, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"RBirchBark-jpg\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></span></div></div><div>Log</div></div><div><div><div id=\"RBirchSanded-jpg\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></span></div></div><div>Sanded</div></div><div><div><div id=\"RBirchPlanked-jpg\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></span></div></div><div>Planked</div></div></div>\n\n</div>"}
